sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Clinician
  participant CA as clinic-api
  participant PA as payer-api
  actor R as UM reviewer
  C->>CA: Sign MRI order
  CA->>PA: CRD order-sign hook
  PA-->>CA: Card "PA + documentation needed"
  C->>CA: Open documentation
  CA->>PA: Questionnaire/$questionnaire-package
  PA-->>CA: Questionnaire + libraries
  CA-->>C: Form prefilled from chart (DTR)
  C->>CA: Complete form, submit prior auth
  CA->>PA: Claim/$submit (PAS bundle)
  PA-->>CA: ClaimResponse: pended, deadline set
  R->>PA: Open queue, request documents
  PA->>CA: CDex Task (attachment request)
  C->>CA: Attach note
  CA->>PA: Claim/$submit-attachment
  R->>PA: Approve (Provenance)
  PA-)CA: rest-hook: ClaimResponse changed
  CA->>PA: Claim/$inquire
  PA-->>CA: Approved, preAuthRef
  CA-->>C: Inbox: approved, auth number shown
